('O-2026-10-07-CL91-M2-U2-STATE-SEMANTICS','reconciliation','Reconcile M2 Founder Portrait and U2 servant-history state names','Two still-active RegionBehavior request paths are absent from predeclared ledger: M2 founderPortraitOpened versus founderPortraitObserved and U2 servantHistoryObserved versus servantHistoryInterpreted. These are potentially distinct meaning stages, not trivial typos.','Review staged physical reveal and history interpretation authority; decide whether to extend governed ledger schema with separate fields or to update each source path after semantic approval, then guarded PREVIEW/APPLY and independent read-only FINAL VERIFY.','Approved M2 opened/revealed vs observed state semantics and U2 observation vs interpreted-story semantics; exact source hashes and state migration policy.','P1','blocked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL90-KERNEL-CONTRACT-AUDIT');
